      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Type:</strong> Stem plant</li><li><strong>Origin:</strong> North America</li><li><strong>Growth rate:</strong> Medium</li><li><strong>Height:</strong> 20-30+ cm (average height after two months in the tank)</li><li><strong>Light demand:</strong> Medium</li><li><strong>CO2:</strong> Low</li></ul>"
